---
// Section hero : grand titre centre + collage d'images en arriere-plan
---

<section
  id="hero"
  class="relative flex h-svh items-center justify-center overflow-hidden lg:h-screen"
>
  <div class="px-[5%] py-16 md:py-24 lg:py-28">
    <div class="container max-w-lg">
      <div class="relative z-10 text-center">
        <h1 class="mb-5 text-6xl font-bold md:mb-6 md:text-9xl lg:text-10xl">
          Medium length hero heading goes here
        </h1>
        <p class="md:text-md">
          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse
          varius enim in eros elementum tristique. Duis cursus, mi quis viverra
          ornare, eros dolor interdum nulla, ut commodo diam libero vitae erat.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-4 md:mt-8">
          <button
            class="focus-visible:ring-border-primary inline-flex gap-3 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-border-primary bg-background-alternative text-text-alternative px-6 py-3"
            title="Button"
          >
            Button</button
          ><button
            class="focus-visible:ring-border-primary inline-flex gap-3 items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-white transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 border border-border-primary text-text-primary bg-background-primary px-6 py-3"
            title="Button"
          >
            Button
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div
    id="hero-collage"
    class="absolute size-full"
    style="transform:translateX(1.75vw) translateY(1.75vh)"
  >
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 flex origin-bottom items-center justify-center"
      style="transform:translateX(-0.8%) translateY(-0.8%)"
    >
      <div
        class="absolute w-full bottom-[5%] left-[-8%] z-10 max-w-[18%] sm:bottom-[10%] lg:bottom-auto"
      >
        <img
          src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image.svg"
          alt="Relume placeholder image 1"
          class="size-full"
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute w-full left-[30%] top-[8%] z-10 max-w-[18%] sm:top-[10%] sm:max-w-[12%] lg:left-[40%] lg:top-[5%]"
      >
        <img
          src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image.svg"
          alt="Relume placeholder image 2"
          class="size-full"
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute w-full bottom-[-5%] right-[-5%] z-10 max-w-[25%] lg:max-w-[18%]"
      >
        <img
          src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image.svg"
          alt="Relume placeholder image 3"
          class="size-full"
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute w-full bottom-[-2%] left-[20%] z-10 max-w-[18%] sm:bottom-[-5%] sm:max-w-[16%] lg:bottom-[-10%]"
      >
        <img
          src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image.svg"
          alt="Relume placeholder image 4"
          class="size-full"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 flex origin-bottom items-center justify-center"
      style="transform:translateX(-0.2%) translateY(-0.2%)"
    >
      <div
        class="absolute w-full left-[2%] top-[-5%] max-w-[30%] sm:left-[5%] sm:max-w-[18%] lg:left-[10%] lg:top-[-10%]"
      >
        <img
          src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image-landscape.svg"
          alt="Relume placeholder image 5"
          class="size-full"
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute w-full right-[20%] top-[-2%] max-w-[25%] sm:top-[5%] sm:max-w-[16%] lg:right-[20%] lg:top-[-10%]"
      >
        <img
          src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image.svg"
          alt="Relume placeholder image 6"
          class="size-full"
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute w-full right-[-5%] top-[10%] max-w-[20%] sm:max-w-[15%] lg:top-[25%]"
      >
        <img
          src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image-landscape.svg"
          alt="Relume placeholder image 7"
          class="size-full"
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute w-full bottom-[5%] right-[32%] max-w-[18%] sm:right-[30%] sm:max-w-[15%] lg:bottom-[5%] lg:max-w-[12%]"
      >
        <img
          src="https://d22po4pjz3o32e.cloudfront.net/placeholder-image-landscape.svg"
          alt="Relume placeholder image 8"
          class="size-full"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
